  "description": "A Connector API (InterApp calls/messages) for DataMiner elements running the 'GitHub Repositories' connector. Lets Automation scripts and connectors create repositories, manage collaborators and topics, and add or trigger GitHub Actions workflows.\n[Minimum Required DataMiner: 10.1.11]\n[Minimum Required connector version: 1.0.0.9]\nCode Entry Point: var github = new GithubRepositories(engine.GetUserConnection(), \"My GitHub Element\");\nRefer to the readme for more information.",
